# C13 (spec 1.5). Sign in with auth.http. The HTTP client keeps access cookies.
# Self uses users@update; foreign writes and direct email/status need update_any too.
@userId = <your-user-id>
@targetUserId = <another-user-id>
@challengeId = <challengeId-from-202>

### Name change: 200 with exactly seven profile fields; repeating it is a timestamp no-op
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"displayName": "  Eva  "}

### Clear the display name
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"displayName": null}

### Direct self email without update_any: 403; use the challenge below
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "new@example.com"}

### Start self email change: 202; inspect Mailpit at localhost:8025
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/email-change
Content-Type: application/json

{"newEmail": "new@example.com"}

### Resend: 429 until 60 seconds; at most five issued emails per hour
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/email-change/resend
Content-Type: application/json

{"challengeId": "{{challengeId}}"}

### Confirm OTP with the same active session: 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/email-change/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{"challengeId": "{{challengeId}}", "code": "<six-digits-from-mail>"}

### With EMAIL_CHANGE_METHOD=magic_link: POST the mail's fragment token
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/email-change/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{"token": "<challengeId.secret-from-fragment>"}

### Normalize and replace a photo: WebStorm asks you to select a local image
# Exactly one file, JPEG/PNG/WebP, <=5 MiB; no other multipart fields.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/photo
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=course-photo

--course-photo
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="photo.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./photo.jpg
--course-photo--

### The normalized WebP is served through the protected API
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/photo

### Clear photo: 204, no body; repeat is a timestamp no-op
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/photo

### Admin direct email: 200; cancels an outstanding self challenge as admin_override
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/{{targetUserId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "admin-updated@example.com"}

### Admin block: stops access/refresh; cannot block the last RBAC manager (409)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/{{targetUserId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "blocked"}

### Admin unblock (pending/deleting/deleted cannot be changed this way)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/{{targetUserId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "active"}

### Reject duplicate JSON keys: 400
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"displayName": "first", "displayName": "second"}
